-- src:3714 | (b) a company limited by guarantee; or
-- src:3716 | (c) an unlimited company,
-- src:3718 | as the case may be, and where applicable, that it is a private company.
@ref s 19(4) (src:3707-3718)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 19 and 20 act`
